<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta name="description" content="A responsive workspace website">
    <title>Groundwork | Responsive Interface</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body>

    <header class="site-header">
        <a class="brand" href="#overview">
            <span class="brand-mark">g.</span>
            <span>groundwork</span>
        </a>

        <button class="menu-toggle" id="menuToggle"
                aria-label="Toggle navigation"
                aria-expanded="false">☰</button>

        <nav class="nav-links" id="navLinks">
            <a href="#overview">Overview</a>
            <a href="#workspace">Workspace</a>
            <a href="#resources">Resources</a>
            <a class="nav-cta" href="#workspace">Get started ↗</a>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
        <section class="hero" id="overview">
            <div class="hero-copy">
                <p class="eyebrow">
                    <span class="status-dot"></span>
                    YOUR SPACE TO GROW
                </p>

                <h1>Make room for<br><em>good work.</em></h1>

                <p class="hero-description">
                    A thoughtful workspace for turning small ideas into
                    meaningful progress. Plan your day, focus on what
                    matters, and keep moving forward.
                </p>

                <div class="hero-actions">
                    <a class="button button-dark" href="#workspace">
                        Explore workspace →
                    </a>
                    <a class="text-link" href="#resources">
                        See how it works
                    </a>
                </div>

                <div class="hero-note">
                    <span class="avatar-stack">
                        <i>J</i><i>M</i><i>A</i>
                    </span>
                    <span>Made for curious minds and better days.</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="hero-art" role="img"
                 aria-label="Illustration of an organized workspace">
                <div class="sun"></div>
                <div class="art-leaf leaf-one"></div>
                <div class="art-leaf leaf-two"></div>

                <div class="art-card">
                    <div class="art-card-top">
                        <span>MONDAY, OCT 26</span>
                        <span>•••</span>
                    </div>

                    <h2>Today's focus</h2>

                    <div class="task-line">
                        <span class="check">✓</span>
                        <span>Sketch the big idea</span>
                        <b>10:00</b>
                    </div>

                    <div class="task-line">
                        <span class="check">✓</span>
                        <span>Take a mindful break</span>
                        <b>11:30</b>
                    </div>

                    <div class="task-line unfinished">
                        <span class="empty-check"></span>
                        <span>Build something useful</span>
                        <b>14:00</b>
                    </div>

                    <div class="progress-label">
                        <span>Daily progress</span>
                        <strong>68%</strong>
                    </div>

                    <div class="progress-track">
                        <span></span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="floating-note">
                    <span class="sparkle">✳</span>
                    <div>
                        <strong>One step at a time</strong>
                        <small>Progress over perfection</small>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="metrics">
            <div><strong>01</strong><span>Start with clarity</span></div>
            <div><strong>02</strong><span>Focus on the essential</span></div>
            <div><strong>03</strong><span>Celebrate progress</span></div>
        </section>

        <section class="workspace-section" id="workspace">
            <div class="section-heading">
                <div>
                    <p class="eyebrow">A LITTLE STRUCTURE GOES A LONG WAY</p>
                    <h2>Your day, with <em>intention.</em></h2>
                </div>

                <p>
                    Simple tools to help you organize your thoughts
                    and give your best ideas a place to grow.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="workspace-grid">
                <article class="feature-card feature-primary">
                    <div class="feature-icon">✎</div>
                    <p class="card-kicker">PLAN WITH PURPOSE</p>
                    <h3>Turn thoughts<br>into next steps.</h3>
                    <p>
                        Break a big goal into small, doable actions.
                        Your next step is closer than you think.
                    </p>
                    <a href="#resources" class="round-arrow"
                       aria-label="Explore planning resources">↗</a>
                    <div class="decorative-lines">
                        <span></span><span></span><span></span>
                    </div>
                </article>

                <article class="feature-card feature-blue">
                    <div class="feature-icon">◷</div>
                    <p class="card-kicker">PROTECT YOUR FOCUS</p>
                    <h3>Make space<br>for deep work.</h3>
                    <p>
                        Give your attention one home at a time,
                        and let the noise wait outside.
                    </p>
                    <a href="#resources" class="round-arrow"
                       aria-label="Explore focus resources">↗</a>
                    <div class="mini-clock">
                        <span>25</span><small>MIN</small>
                    </div>
                </article>

                <article class="feature-card feature-light">
                    <div class="feature-icon">✳</div>
                    <p class="card-kicker">NOTICE YOUR GROWTH</p>
                    <h3>Little wins<br>add up.</h3>
                    <p>
                        Progress isn't always loud. Take a moment
                        to notice how far you've come.
                    </p>
                    <a href="#resources" class="round-arrow"
                       aria-label="Explore growth resources">↗</a>
                    <div class="growth-bars">
                        <i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i>
                    </div>
                </article>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="quote-section" id="resources">
            <div class="quote-mark">“</div>

            <blockquote>
                You don't have to see the whole staircase.
                Just take the first step.
            </blockquote>

            <p>A GENTLER WAY TO GET THINGS DONE</p>

            <button class="button button-outline" id="inspireButton">
                A little inspiration ✳
            </button>

            <p class="inspiration-message" id="inspirationMessage"
               aria-live="polite">
                Small steps still move you forward.
            </p>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="site-footer">
        <a class="brand" href="#overview">
            <span class="brand-mark">g.</span>
            <span>groundwork</span>
        </a>

        <p>Built with care. Designed for real life.</p>
        <span>© 2026 Groundwork Studio</span>
    </footer>

    <script src="script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>